  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 2.9% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $286.24B (2.9% lower over 30D) points to contracting crypto dollar liquidity\u2014often a tighter tape for market-making, DeFi collateral, and risk appetite. Related: <a href=\"https://decrypt.co/381850/polygon-stablecoin-payments-open-money-stack-solana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Polygon Extends Its Stablecoin Payments Infrastructure to Solana</a> (Decrypt).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/news/tokens/usdt-vs-usdc-what-backs-them-and-how-dollar-redemptions-work\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">USDT vs. USDC: What Backs Them and How Dollar Redemptions Work</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Policy and reserves are resetting issuer priorities:</strong> Issuer and platform share can shift before aggregate market cap does, because policy and reserve quality determine which names institutions will hold. Related: <a href=\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/tethers-excess-reserves-nearly-double-to-8b-as-q3-profit-hits-15b?utm_source=rss_feed&amp;utm_medium=rss&amp;utm_campaign=rss_partner_inbound\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Tether\u2019s excess reserves nearly double to $8B as Q3 profit hits $1.5B</a> (CoinTelegraph).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
